1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Hong Kong, 2026

2
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:07,600
No crash. No dent. Then the claims.

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,800
Arrests, and not only in Hong Kong

4
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:16,200
Hundreds of cases. Millions claimed.

5
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:20,000
How do you prove a negative?

6
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,200
Prove the lane was empty

7
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:25,500
A lane change across a solid line

8
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:28,500
Someone nearby is filming

9
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:29,500
Weeks later…

10
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,200
A claim: “I was right behind you”

11
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:35,200
No crash, so nothing was recorded

12
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,700
Turn the claim into a zone

13
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,700
Record where radar saw free space

14
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:41,700
Seal the record in the car

15
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:43,700
Share only the claimed zone

16
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:47,200
Refute only when a miss is unlikely

17
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,200
Same claim, two cars

18
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:53,200
One has nothing. One has evidence.

19
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:56,200
Keep evidence of empty space

20
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:59,200
The car crosses the solid line

21
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:00,900
Radar logs free space, sealed

22
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:04,600
Replay: was the claimed zone empty?

23
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:05,900
Observed empty: claim refuted

24
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:08,900
What if a truck hides the zone?

25
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:12,200
Not seen means no refutation

26
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,100
A zone, healthy sensors, a seal

27
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:17,900
Nothing hidden, every verdict graded

28
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:21,200
Each part tested in simulation

29
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:25,900
The insurer checks the sealed record

30
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:29,200
Plain words for the driver

31
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:32,200
If the car can’t see, it says so

32
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:35,200
Real claims are confirmed, too

33
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:41,100
Simulated results

34
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:46,200
Evidence by design, not by video

35
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:51,700
Headlines paraphrased; sources listed

